## Exact ordered list of validations and side-effects for POST /api/owners

1. Spring Security `@PreAuthorize("hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)")` — 403/entry-point via advice re-throw if unauthorized.
2. Bean Validation on `@Valid OwnerFieldsDto` (before method body): `@NotNull`/`@Size`/`@Pattern` on firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone; `@Size`+`@Email` on email if present → failure = 400 (`MethodArgumentNotValidException` handler).
3. `rejectBlankOwnerFields` — whitespace-only firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone → 400 (`InvalidOwnerFieldsException`).
4. If `sharesHousehold` is not `TRUE`: `rejectDuplicateHousehold` — loads all owners, compares canonical (trim/collapse-whitespace/lowercase) lastName+address → 409 (`DuplicateOwnerHouseholdException`) on match. Skipped if either value is null.
5. `telephoneNormalizer.normalize(telephone)` — canonicalize to E.164; if not `+` and 8-15 digits → 400 (`InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["telephone"])`).
6. `rejectDuplicateTelephone(normalized)` — loads all owners, canonicalizes each telephone, compares → 409 (`DuplicateOwnerTelephoneException`) on match.
7. Mutate DTO: set telephone = normalized E.164; set email = lower-cased (or null).
8. `ownerMapper.toOwner(dto)` — map to `Owner` (id and pets ignored).
9. If `registrationDate` null → set to `LocalDate.now()`.
10. Set `customerCode` = `nextCustomerCode(lastName)` = `<UPPER first 3 of lastName>-<0000-padded (findAllOwners().size()+1)>` (loads all owners again).
11. `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` (`@Transactional`) → `ownerRepository.save(owner)` → Spring Data JPA `persist` (INSERT). Hibernate pre-persist Bean Validation re-checks Owner entity constraints (`@NotEmpty` firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone, `@Pattern` telephone E.164, `@Email` email) at flush; a DB constraint violation surfaces as `DataIntegrityViolationException` → 404 via advice.
12. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)` — build response DTO (adds derived `displayName` and `initials`).
13. Set `Location` header `/api/owners/{id}` and return 201 CREATED.

No emails, notifications, or published application events occur anywhere on this path; the only logging is inside the exception advice handlers.
